e\n```\n\nThis playbook adheres to the given instructions, ensuring each task is correctly named and ordered as specified. It also includes conditionals where necessary, adhering to Ansible best practices.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-07T09:35:21.300761278Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 10963344665, 'load_duration': 53794163, 'prompt_eval_count': 787, 'prompt_eval_duration': 373475502, 'eval_count': 522, 'eval_duration': 10534731146, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--1ba535e4-732a-4459-9fdc-d61b3487e5b0-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 787, 'output_tokens': 522, 'total_tokens': 1309}
