dation.rc == 0\n\n- name: Start and enable rsyslog service\n  ansible.builtin.service:\n    name: "{{ rsyslog_service }}"\n    state: started\n    enabled: true\n```\n\n### Explanation of Changes:\n1. **Syntax Error Fix**: The `loop` variable in the "Validate additional rsyslog config files" task was corrected from `rsyslog_extra_files.results` to `rsyslog_rsyslog_d_files | dict2items`, which matches the loop variable used earlier in the playbook. This resolves the syntax error caused by an undefined variable.\n2. **Removed Backticks**: The error message indicated a syntax error due to backticks, which are not used in the corrected playbook.\n3. **Consistency**: Ensured all tasks remain consistent with the original playbook\'s structure and logic.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'phi4:14b', 'created_at': '2025-10-07T10:26:20.630231721Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 14477545775, 'load_duration': 58081885, 'prompt_eval_count': 1368, 'prompt_eval_duration': 18567865, 'eval_count': 694, 'eval_duration': 14400119162, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--ac64800c-25b9-45b4-812c-e7d6c751dc51-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 1368, 'output_tokens': 694, 'total_tokens': 2062}
